cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "A parity obstruction to degree-optimal syndrome extraction in bivariate bicycle codes — code and data"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code, data, SAT certificates and figures for the study of the
  interleaved syndrome-extraction depth of two-block (bivariate bicycle)
  quantum LDPC codes: the degree bound, the distinct-sums obstruction at
  depth six, the componentwise mod-4 obstruction and its two corollaries, the
  2-height lemma and the twisted-schedule construction, the class-schedule
  template search up to modulus 512, the code search behind the Pareto tables,
  and eighteen machine-checked DRAT refutations.
